# Portfolio video build artefacts
portfolio-video/*/node_modules/
portfolio-video/*/snapshots/
portfolio-video/*/renders/work-*/
portfolio-video/*/renders/.*hf-transaction*/
portfolio-video/*/renders/master.mp4
portfolio-video/*/.hyperframes/

# HyperFrames authoring skills — restore with:
#   npx skills add heygen-com/hyperframes
# skills-lock.json pins the exact versions, so the toolchain stays reproducible
# without vendoring 19 MB of third-party skill content into this repository.
.agents/
.claude/skills/

# Exception to the blanket data/ rule above: the film's frozen extracts are
# aggregate values already published in outputs/analysis/, not row-level
# records. Without them the compositions cannot be traced back to source.
!portfolio-video/pedidosya/src/data/
!portfolio-video/pedidosya/src/data/*.json
